   "widgets_values": [
    "Golden hour. The character surfs inside the curl of one huge three-metre wave, standing on her yellow hibiscus surfboard with both bare feet planted on it. She looks worried, eyes wide, glancing up at the wall of water rolling over her. One hand trails along the wave face, the other arm points forward for balance. A few seagulls fly low over the sea.\n\nFar in the background, small and soft-focus on the water near the shore, a few other surfers paddle on their own boards: adult men and women with short dark hair, in black wetsuits. None of them looks like the character.\n\nMedium-wide shot, three-quarter view."
   ],
   "widgets_values_named": {
    "value": "Golden hour. The character surfs inside the curl of one huge three-metre wave, standing on her yellow hibiscus surfboard with both bare feet planted on it. She looks worried, eyes wide, glancing up at the wall of water rolling over her. One hand trails along the wave face, the other arm points forward for balance. A few seagulls fly low over the sea.\n\nFar in the background, small and soft-focus on the water near the shore, a few other surfers paddle on their own boards: adult men and women with short dark hair, in black wetsuits. None of them looks like the character.\n\nMedium-wide shot, three-quarter view."
   }
